# SciTeX ML — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env` and adjust as needed. All are optional; defaults are shown.

# --- SciTeX Voice V1: speaker embedding / inference -------------------------

# Inference device override for scitex_ml.inference.resolve_device().
# "cpu", "cuda", or "cuda:N". Unset -> auto (cuda iff torch reports it, else cpu).
# On compute-03/04 (GTX 1070, Pascal) a CUDA run needs a torch<=2.7 cu12x wheel.
# SCITEX_ML_DEVICE=cpu

# Local cache dir for ECAPA-TDNN weights (never leaves the WireGuard mesh).
# Default: ~/.cache/scitex-ml/ecapa
# SCITEX_ML_ECAPA_DIR=/home/ywatanabe/.cache/scitex-ml/ecapa

# ECAPA model source (SpeechBrain/HF id or a local directory).
# Default: speechbrain/spkrec-ecapa-voxceleb
# SCITEX_ML_ECAPA_SOURCE=speechbrain/spkrec-ecapa-voxceleb
